        <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>
            Service Providers list their services with full details, pricing, and availability.
          </li>
          <li>Clients browse through verified listings, compare options, and book instantly.</li>
          <li>The Platform ensures secure communication, payment, and satisfaction tracking.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="box border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 shadow rounded-md p-5 scale-105 duration-900 bg-[#f8f8f8] dark:bg-gray-800">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 pb-4">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            height="50px"
            viewBox="0 -960 960 960"
            width="50px"
            fill="#999999"
            class="dark:fill-gray-400"
          >
            <path d="M200-120q-33 0-56.5-23.5T120-200v-160h80v160h160v80H200Zm560 0H600v-80h160v-160h80v160q0 33-23.5 56.5T760-120ZM120-760q0-33 23.5-56.5T200-840h160v80H200v160h-80v-160Zm720 0v160h-80v-160H600v-80h160q33 0 56.5 23.5T840-760ZM480-240q21 0 35.5-14.5T530-290q0-21-14.5-35.5T480-340q-21 0-35.5 14.5T430-290q0 21 14.5 35.5T480-240Zm-36-153h73q0-34 8-52t35-45q35-35 46.5-56.5T618-598q0-54-39-88t-99-34q-50 0-86 26t-52 74l66 27q7-26 26.5-42.5T480-652q29 0 46.5 15.5T544-595q0 20-9.5 37.5T502-521q-33 29-45.5 56T444-393Z" />
          </svg>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Why Choose ServiceHub?</h2>
        </div>

        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>Wide range of verified services</li>
          <li>Safe and secure transactions</li>
          <li>Real reviews and ratings</li>
          <li>Quick booking and easy management</li>
          <li>Opportunity for providers to grow and earn</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-[90%] mx-auto grid sm:grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-5 py-20">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-lg shadow-md p-5 hover:scale-105 duration-300">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="75px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="75px" fill="#e3e3e3"><path d="M440-120v-80h320v-284q0-117-81.5-198.5T480-764q-117 0-198.5 81.5T200-484v244h-40q-33 0-56.5-23.5T80-320v-80q0-21 10.5-39.5T120-469l3-53q8-68 39.5-126t79-101q47.5-43 109-67T480-840q68 0 129 24t109 66.5Q766-707 797-649t40 126l3 52q19 9 29.5 27t10.5 38v92q0 20-10.5 38T840-249v49q0 33-23.5 56.5T760-120H440Zm-80-280q-17 0-28.5-11.5T320-440q0-17 11.5-28.5T360-480q17 0 28.5 11.5T400-440q0 17-11.5 28.5T360-400Zm240 0q-17 0-28.5-11.5T560-440q0-17 11.5-28.5T600-480q17 0 28.5 11.5T640-440q0 17-11.5 28.5T600-400Zm-359-62q-7-106 64-182t177-76q89 0 156.5 56.5T720-519q-91-1-167.5-49T435-698q-16 80-67.5 142.5T241-462Z"/></svg>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2 mt-2">
        For Service Providers
      </h2>
      <p class="text-md text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2">
        Expand your reach, manage your bookings, and grow your business with ease. We help you showcase your services to the right audience and turn your skills into steady income.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-lg shadow-md p-5 hover:scale-105 duration-300">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="75px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="75px" fill="#e3e3e3"><path d="M38-428q-18-36-28-73T0-576q0-112 76-188t188-76q63 0 120 26.5t96 73.5q39-47 96-73.5T696-840q112 0 188 76t76 188q0 38-10 75t-28 73q-11-19-26-34t-35-24q9-23 14-45t5-45q0-78-53-131t-131-53q-81 0-124.5 44.5T480-616q-48-56-91.5-100T264-760q-78 0-131 53T80-576q0 23 5 45t14 45q-20 9-35 24t-26 34ZM0-80v-63q0-44 44.5-70.5T160-240q13 0 25 .5t23 2.5q-14 20-21 43t-7 49v65H0Zm240 0v-65q0-65 66.5-105T480-290q108 0 174 40t66 105v65H240Zm540 0v-65q0-26-6.5-49T754-237q11-2 22.5-2.5t23.5-.5q72 0 116 26.5t44 70.5v63H780ZM480-210q-57 0-102 15t-53 35h311q-9-20-53.5-35T480-210Zm-320-70q-33 0-56.5-23.5T80-360q0-34 23.5-57t56.5-23q34 0 57 23t23 57q0 33-23 56.5T160-280Zm640 0q-33 0-56.5-23.5T720-360q0-34 23.5-57t56.5-23q34 0 57 23t23 57q0 33-23 56.5T800-280Zm-320-40q-50 0-85-35t-35-85q0-51 35-85.5t85-34.5q51 0 85.5 34.5T600-440q0 50-34.5 85T480-320Zm0-160q-17 0-28.5 11.5T440-440q0 17 11.5 28.5T480-400q17 0 28.5-11.5T520-440q0-17-11.5-28.5T480-480Zm0 40Zm1 280Z"/></svg>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2 mt-2">For Customers</h2>
      <p class="text-md text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2">
        Say goodbye to long searches and uncertain pricing. Compare, book, and experience professional services — anytime, anywhere.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-lg shadow-md p-5 hover:scale-105 duration-300">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="75px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="75px" fill="#e3e3e3"><path d="M240-80q-50 0-85-35t-35-85v-120h120v-560h600v680q0 50-35 85t-85 35H240Zm480-80q17 0 28.5-11.5T760-200v-600H320v480h360v120q0 17 11.5 28.5T720-160ZM360-600v-80h360v80H360Zm0 120v-80h360v80H360ZM240-160h360v-80H200v40q0 17 11.5 28.5T240-160Zm0 0h-40 400-360Z"/></svg>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2 mt-2">Our Promise</h2>
      <p class="text-md text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2">
        We're committed to building a community built on trust, transparency, and quality. Our platform is designed to ensure a smooth experience for everyone — from first-time users to professional service providers.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-lg shadow-md p-5 hover:scale-105 duration-300">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="75px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="75px" fill="#e3e3e3"><path d="M475-160q4 0 8-2t6-4l328-328q12-12 17.5-27t5.5-30q0-16-5.5-30.5T817-607L647-777q-11-12-25.5-17.5T591-800q-15 0-30 5.5T534-777l-11 11 74 75q15 14 22 32t7 38q0 42-28.5 70.5T527-522q-20 0-38.5-7T456-550l-75-74-175 175q-3 3-4.5 6.5T200-435q0 8 6 14.5t14 6.5q4 0 8-2t6-4l136-136 56 56-135 136q-3 3-4.5 6.5T285-350q0 8 6 14t14 6q4 0 8-2t6-4l136-135 56 56-135 136q-3 2-4.5 6t-1.5 8q0 8 6 14t14 6q4 0 7.5-1.5t6.5-4.5l136-135 56 56-136 136q-3 3-4.5 6.5T454-180q0 8 6.5 14t14.5 6Zm-1 80q-37 0-65.5-24.5T375-166q-34-5-57-28t-28-57q-34-5-56.5-28.5T206-336q-38-5-62-33t-24-66q0-20 7.5-38.5T149-506l232-231 131 131q2 3 6 4.5t8 1.5q9 0 15-5.5t6-14.5q0-4-1.5-8t-4.5-6L398-777q-11-12-25.5-17.5T342-800q-15 0-30 5.5T285-777L144-635q-9 9-15 21t-8 24q-2 12 0 24.5t8 23.5l-58 58q-17-23-25-50.5T40-590q2-28 14-54.5T87-692l141-141q24-23 53.5-35t60.5-12q31 0 60.5 12t52.5 35l11 11 11-11q24-23 53.5-35t60.5-12q31 0 60.5 12t52.5 35l169 169q23 23 35 53t12 61q0 31-12 60.5T873-437L545-110q-14 14-32.5 22T474-80Zm-99-560Z"/></svg>
